Z||000009||1FST2M6||01-19-2001||08:39 AM||||it should come with new springs jeff... you'll trash the stock retainers with the stock springs they'll collapse and can break! the crane ones are thinner and stronger..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
